1 sort bitvec 4
2 sort bitvec 1
3 input 1 a
4 input 1 b
; a - b overflows when it borrows (a < b),
; so usubo is equivalent to ult.
5 usubo 2 3 4
6 ult 2 3 4
7 neq 2 5 6
8 bad 7
; a + b overflows when the sum wraps around,
; and a wrapped sum ends up less than both operands.
9 uaddo 2 3 4
10 add 1 3 4
11 ult 2 10 3
12 neq 2 9 11
13 bad 12
14 ult 2 10 4
15 neq 2 9 14
16 bad 15
